WEBVTT

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:26.210
ashita he tsuzuku sakamichi no tochuu de

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:26.210
On the uphill road that leads to tomorrow

00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:32.510
surechigau otona tachi wa tsubuyaku no sa

00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:32.510
We pass by adults who tell us this

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:37.640
"ai toka yume toka risou mo wakaru kedo

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:37.640
"I can understand ideals such as love and dreams

00:00:39.850 --> 00:00:43.810
me no mae no genjitsu wa sonna ni amaku nai" tte

00:00:39.850 --> 00:00:43.810
but the real world isn't as easy as you think"

00:00:44.940 --> 00:00:50.150
tsumazuki nagara mo korogari nagara mo

00:00:44.940 --> 00:00:50.150
Even though we keep tripping and falling

00:00:50.940 --> 00:00:55.360
kasabuta darake no jyounetsu wo wasuretaku nai

00:00:50.940 --> 00:00:55.360
We have to remember these pains of growing up

00:00:56.320 --> 00:00:58.830
otona ni narenai bokura no

00:00:56.320 --> 00:00:58.830
For all of us who can't force ourselves to do so yet

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.330
tsuyogari wo hitotsu kiite kure

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.330
Listen to this one thing I have to say

00:01:02.250 --> 00:01:04.540
nige mo kakure mo shinai kara

00:01:02.250 --> 00:01:04.540
I won't run or cower away

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:07.460
waraitai yatsu dake warae

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:07.460
So whoever wants to laugh at me, go ahead

00:01:07.710 --> 00:01:10.250
semete tayori nai bokura no

00:01:07.710 --> 00:01:10.250
Since we can't be relied upon yet

00:01:10.460 --> 00:01:12.800
jiyuu no me wo tsumitoranai de

00:01:10.460 --> 00:01:12.800
Don't take away our seed of freedom

00:01:13.420 --> 00:01:15.800
mizu wo ageru sono yakume wo

00:01:13.420 --> 00:01:15.800
The task of nurturing this plant

00:01:15.880 --> 00:01:18.890
hataseba iindarou?

00:01:15.880 --> 00:01:18.890
That's all we have to do, right?

00:01:29.980 --> 00:01:30.020
{Intro}

00:01:36.740 --> 00:01:37.740
Sherry...

00:01:39.240 --> 00:01:40.280
Koko!

00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:41.870
Are you all right?

00:01:42.910 --> 00:01:44.330
Where are we?

00:01:44.330 --> 00:01:45.710
In a tunnel.

00:01:45.710 --> 00:01:46.960
A tunnel?

00:01:46.960 --> 00:01:49.170
It's dark, and I don't
know where we are.

00:01:49.170 --> 00:01:50.540
Where's the way out?

00:01:50.540 --> 00:01:51.750
I don't know...

00:01:53.300 --> 00:01:55.840
What if we can never get out?

00:01:55.840 --> 00:01:59.010
Will we be inside this
dark tunnel forever?

00:01:59.680 --> 00:02:00.850
Let's walk.

00:02:01.180 --> 00:02:04.470
If we keep walking, we'll
eventually find the way out.

00:02:04.470 --> 00:02:09.230
And as long as we're out of here,
we will definitely find happiness.

00:02:11.480 --> 00:02:12.520
Right?

00:02:13.780 --> 00:02:14.860
Yeah!

00:02:20.570 --> 00:02:20.620
{Part A}

00:02:24.370 --> 00:02:28.960
Sherry, The Rhapsody of Fate

00:02:29.290 --> 00:02:31.130
Training!

00:02:31.500 --> 00:02:34.210
Training! Training! Training!

00:02:34.210 --> 00:02:35.260
Quit it!

00:02:36.210 --> 00:02:38.800
Geez, this early on a Sunday morning...

00:02:38.800 --> 00:02:40.300
Kiyomaro!

00:02:40.300 --> 00:02:42.550
This is no time to be lazy!

00:02:42.550 --> 00:02:46.270
We have to train in case someone
strong like Brago appears.

00:02:46.600 --> 00:02:49.640
I got it. I got it, so let go of me.

00:02:49.640 --> 00:02:50.690
Sure.

00:02:52.190 --> 00:02:54.900
Training! Training! Training!

00:02:55.360 --> 00:02:56.480
Brago, eh?

00:02:56.860 --> 00:02:58.950
I wonder where they are right now.

00:02:59.150 --> 00:03:00.780
Let's go, Vulcan!

00:03:01.240 --> 00:03:02.620
Leave Vulcan home!

00:03:04.990 --> 00:03:07.250
You can't do this to me, Kiyomaro!

00:03:07.250 --> 00:03:08.660
Shut up!

00:03:15.920 --> 00:03:17.210
I don't like this.

00:03:24.600 --> 00:03:25.600
I don't like it at all.

00:03:28.020 --> 00:03:29.600
A weakling like you...

00:03:30.140 --> 00:03:32.270
Baring his fangs at me...

00:03:41.910 --> 00:03:43.200
Sherry.

00:03:52.710 --> 00:03:54.290
Why cook it?

00:03:54.290 --> 00:03:56.840
You'd get more energy
from eating it raw.

00:03:56.840 --> 00:03:57.920
Idiot.

00:03:57.920 --> 00:04:01.170
Shut up!
I'm barely tolerating this!

00:04:01.970 --> 00:04:06.600
I said to go get fish, so why
did you bring an alligator?!

00:04:06.600 --> 00:04:09.270
It's his fault for baring his fangs at me.

00:04:09.890 --> 00:04:11.140
Come on...

00:04:11.140 --> 00:04:12.850
You're exhausted, right?

00:04:13.810 --> 00:04:18.150
Eat some meat and get your energy up, or
you'll collapse before the fight even begins.

00:04:19.070 --> 00:04:20.610
Don't mock me.

00:04:20.610 --> 00:04:22.280
I won't be a burden.

00:04:23.070 --> 00:04:24.200
That would be nice.

00:04:27.370 --> 00:04:28.700
Mr. Cook...

00:04:28.700 --> 00:04:30.410
Some yellowtail, please!

00:04:28.700 --> 00:04:30.410
Gash says "buri", which can be
quite a few different fish in Japanese.

00:04:30.410 --> 00:04:32.620
I thought we were
supposed to be training.

00:04:32.620 --> 00:04:35.000
If you're hungry, you
won't have the energy.

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:36.790
You have to fill up your stomach first.

00:04:36.790 --> 00:04:38.090
Here you are, yellowtail.

00:04:41.210 --> 00:04:42.550
Another, please!

00:04:42.970 --> 00:04:45.010
Why not eat something
other than yellowtail?

00:04:45.010 --> 00:04:46.890
No, yellowtail is enough for me.

00:04:47.100 --> 00:04:48.760
- Yellowtail!
- Here.

00:04:48.760 --> 00:04:50.470
- Yellowtail...
- Here!

00:04:51.060 --> 00:04:53.060
That's a lot of yellowtail...

00:04:53.060 --> 00:04:54.690
Yellowtail! Yellowtail!

00:04:54.940 --> 00:04:56.480
Gash, you ate that much...

00:04:57.560 --> 00:04:59.320
Mister!

00:05:02.740 --> 00:05:04.740
Yellowtail is best when it's eaten whole.

00:05:07.160 --> 00:05:08.870
Do all demons...

00:05:09.280 --> 00:05:12.830
eat this much?

00:05:15.750 --> 00:05:20.090
But coming here to find
opponents is pointless.

00:05:20.090 --> 00:05:21.550
Why's that?

00:05:24.550 --> 00:05:27.300
The weak ones will disappear,
even if we ignore them.

00:05:27.300 --> 00:05:31.060
We should prepare to fight against more
powerful enemies in the latter half,

00:05:31.060 --> 00:05:32.930
and sharpen our claws instead.

00:05:34.430 --> 00:05:38.270
So you've been fighting fewer
demons on purpose lately?

00:05:38.520 --> 00:05:41.980
No, it's just been harder
to find opponents.

00:05:42.690 --> 00:05:45.570
That means the weak ones are
getting stronger as well.

00:05:47.070 --> 00:05:48.320
However...

00:05:48.700 --> 00:05:53.200
There are also many opponents
afraid to challenge me.

00:05:55.500 --> 00:05:57.710
All right, let's hurry then.

00:06:02.500 --> 00:06:03.960
Staggering behind, I see...

00:06:04.420 --> 00:06:07.760
Why did we have to pair up with
weak humans for the battle?

00:06:09.760 --> 00:06:12.470
If it were just me, I would
have won long ago.

00:06:13.970 --> 00:06:18.060
Well, humans normally sleep once a day,
so I guess not sleeping for three days...

00:06:18.060 --> 00:06:21.110
and still being able to
move is pretty good.

00:06:22.150 --> 00:06:25.280
Looks like she's eager to
end the battle quickly.

00:06:29.570 --> 00:06:32.490
Koko. Koko. Koko!

00:06:34.370 --> 00:06:37.120
Please, stop it!

00:06:40.120 --> 00:06:41.250
Koko!

00:06:41.250 --> 00:06:43.340
It's Belmond's daughter!

00:06:44.090 --> 00:06:45.130
Run!

00:06:49.300 --> 00:06:50.760
Are you okay, Koko?

00:06:50.760 --> 00:06:52.140
I'm fine.

00:06:52.140 --> 00:06:54.430
I just got pushed around a bit.

00:06:54.430 --> 00:06:55.770
Why?!

00:06:57.480 --> 00:07:00.850
They thought I stole some fruit...

00:07:01.850 --> 00:07:03.820
- Those guys!
- It's fine.

00:07:04.190 --> 00:07:06.990
I'm used to getting blamed for things.

00:07:08.320 --> 00:07:11.280
It's futile to talk back
to them, in any case.

00:07:11.700 --> 00:07:15.660
And I have to study... and work, too.

00:07:15.660 --> 00:07:18.750
I'd only be wasting my time
by being angry at them.

00:07:19.790 --> 00:07:23.040
No matter what happens,
I'll be by your side.

00:07:23.920 --> 00:07:26.210
Thank you, Sherry.

00:07:27.170 --> 00:07:29.050
Jee. Tea please.

00:07:29.670 --> 00:07:33.140
Are you angry for
Koko-sama's sake again?

00:07:34.140 --> 00:07:37.100
Why can't anyone see
her good qualities?!

00:07:37.100 --> 00:07:40.390
Just because she's poor, they go
around and do such things...

00:07:40.390 --> 00:07:41.480
She...

00:07:41.480 --> 00:07:44.150
She's the person who saved you,

00:07:44.150 --> 00:07:47.730
and saved your life.

00:07:48.530 --> 00:07:52.030
That's right, it's thanks
to her I'm here right now.

00:07:52.410 --> 00:07:55.660
She's my closest friend, and has always
supported me since then.

00:07:57.080 --> 00:07:59.250
Hey, have I told you about it already?

00:07:59.830 --> 00:08:05.330
About what she said after saving me
from the river I threw myself into.

00:08:06.210 --> 00:08:08.050
Of course.

00:08:08.050 --> 00:08:10.920
You talk about it every month.

00:08:11.630 --> 00:08:12.880
Is that so?

00:08:13.550 --> 00:08:17.310
I will always remember
those words as well.

00:08:17.310 --> 00:08:20.390
Koko-sama is such a wonderful person,

00:08:20.390 --> 00:08:24.810
She's just achieved the
first step towards happiness.

00:08:25.350 --> 00:08:28.360
Earlier, I received a confirmation
that she has been accepted to

00:08:28.360 --> 00:08:32.030
the university she wanted to go to.

00:08:34.860 --> 00:08:37.620
Hurry... To where Koko is!

00:08:37.620 --> 00:08:40.830
There's no need to hurry. Her acceptance
isn't going anywhere.

00:08:41.330 --> 00:08:44.670
It's really true, she got in!

00:08:44.670 --> 00:08:48.750
She should receive a
notification tomorrow.

00:08:49.630 --> 00:08:53.550
No one will make fun of her anymore.

00:08:59.060 --> 00:09:00.140
What's this?!

00:09:02.310 --> 00:09:04.270
- Koko!
- Miss!

00:09:12.900 --> 00:09:13.990
Koko!

00:09:15.700 --> 00:09:16.860
Sherry!

00:09:16.860 --> 00:09:19.030
Look, I did all of this!

00:09:22.370 --> 00:09:23.750
Radomu!

00:09:28.580 --> 00:09:30.800
See, isn't it just great?!

00:09:31.250 --> 00:09:35.130
With this amazing power,
I can pay them all back.

00:09:35.380 --> 00:09:37.180
What are you talking about?

00:09:37.180 --> 00:09:40.430
You said you'd go to a
university and find a good job!

00:09:40.430 --> 00:09:42.640
University? Work?

00:09:42.640 --> 00:09:45.060
I don't care about those anymore.

00:09:45.060 --> 00:09:49.230
As long as I hold this power,
no one will mock me...

00:09:49.230 --> 00:09:50.440
Isn't that right?

00:09:50.440 --> 00:09:52.610
Wrong... That's wrong...

00:09:53.150 --> 00:09:56.780
You wanted to find happiness...
How would this help you?

00:09:56.780 --> 00:09:57.780
Sherry...

00:09:59.700 --> 00:10:02.080
I am happy!

00:10:04.580 --> 00:10:05.870
No way...

00:10:09.750 --> 00:10:12.960
It's your fault that
Koko changed, right?!

00:10:12.960 --> 00:10:14.800
What did you do to her?!

00:10:15.050 --> 00:10:16.720
Nothing much.

00:10:16.720 --> 00:10:18.840
I only changed her feelings a bit.

00:10:19.340 --> 00:10:20.340
Her feelings?

00:10:20.340 --> 00:10:24.310
Increased the hatred and made her
forget all those pointless things,

00:10:24.310 --> 00:10:27.190
with my special power.

00:10:31.110 --> 00:10:34.440
My name is Zophise, and I've
come from a different world.

00:10:35.360 --> 00:10:39.240
There are one hundred children similar
to me who have come here.

00:10:39.950 --> 00:10:43.330
Those one hundred pair up with
humans to fight a battle

00:10:43.330 --> 00:10:45.870
to determine who will become
the king of our world.

00:10:45.870 --> 00:10:47.620
What's this child talking about?

00:10:48.370 --> 00:10:51.000
It's such a fun game;

00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:54.420
being able to make your
darkest wishes reality...

00:10:54.710 --> 00:10:59.380
But Koko had no interest
in power or fighting.

00:10:59.380 --> 00:11:02.470
That's why I had to alter her feelings...

00:11:03.100 --> 00:11:08.100
So that hurting people and destroying
things could be fun for her.

00:11:08.850 --> 00:11:10.520
That's a lie... You're just lying!

00:11:11.020 --> 00:11:12.730
It's a lie, right, Koko?!

00:11:12.730 --> 00:11:14.900
You'd never do this!

00:11:15.940 --> 00:11:16.940
Sherry...

00:11:18.740 --> 00:11:21.360
I did this with my own strength.

00:11:21.360 --> 00:11:23.240
All of this with my own strength!

00:11:27.080 --> 00:11:30.960
Forgive me, but I'm desperately
trying to become king.

00:11:31.330 --> 00:11:34.210
In order to do that,
humans are essential.

00:11:35.000 --> 00:11:36.880
It's the rules of the battle.

00:11:37.590 --> 00:11:44.140
Sherry, if you try to stop me, it
means I'll have to defeat you.

00:11:44.600 --> 00:11:49.100
I just... don't want to lose this power!

00:11:50.180 --> 00:11:51.480
Koko...

00:11:55.150 --> 00:11:57.320
Goodbye, Sherry!

00:11:57.820 --> 00:11:58.820
Sherry!

00:12:00.700 --> 00:12:01.700
What?

00:12:01.990 --> 00:12:03.280
Found them.

00:12:04.200 --> 00:12:06.950
Just some weaklings running
around and hiding.

00:12:06.950 --> 00:12:08.330
What should we do?

00:12:08.700 --> 00:12:10.160
You should know...

00:12:10.540 --> 00:12:12.250
No mercy!

00:12:12.250 --> 00:12:14.920
Destroy them, and burn the book!

00:12:17.550 --> 00:12:21.800
My goal is to end this battle
as quickly as possible!

00:12:30.020 --> 00:12:30.060
{Part B}

00:12:44.320 --> 00:12:46.700
Hey, Gash.
What sort of training is this?

00:12:46.700 --> 00:12:47.700
Kiyomaro!

00:12:48.530 --> 00:12:52.540
I cannot avert my eyes, or
else Naomi-chan will...

00:13:02.590 --> 00:13:05.470
Hey, Gash, finish it up by dinner!

00:13:05.470 --> 00:13:06.640
Understood!

00:13:14.310 --> 00:13:15.640
How peaceful...

00:13:17.440 --> 00:13:18.650
Reisu!

00:13:21.570 --> 00:13:23.990
Now, hand over the book.

00:13:24.820 --> 00:13:27.070
If you don't, we shall take it by force.

00:13:27.410 --> 00:13:29.620
No, I can't give it up...

00:13:29.620 --> 00:13:32.160
Because of this power,
I've finally become rich.

00:13:32.370 --> 00:13:35.580
I want to become wealthier!

00:13:36.920 --> 00:13:37.960
Jyuron!

00:13:41.300 --> 00:13:42.300
Gurabirei!

00:13:45.800 --> 00:13:46.840
Reisu!

00:13:50.010 --> 00:13:51.680
The difference in strength is obvious.

00:13:55.560 --> 00:13:57.190
Hand over the book!

00:13:57.560 --> 00:13:59.310
No... No...

00:13:59.310 --> 00:14:00.980
No!

00:14:01.150 --> 00:14:02.530
Barujyuron!

00:14:07.780 --> 00:14:09.660
I'm relying on you, tree warriors!

00:14:09.660 --> 00:14:10.660
Jyuruku!

00:14:11.950 --> 00:14:12.950
What?

00:14:14.950 --> 00:14:16.660
Trying to hide again?

00:14:16.660 --> 00:14:19.420
Sherry, let's destroy them
now with Giganoreisu!

00:14:21.500 --> 00:14:23.630
What's wrong?
Hurry up with the spell!

00:14:28.430 --> 00:14:29.720
Sherry!

00:14:30.430 --> 00:14:31.430
At a time like this...

00:14:38.850 --> 00:14:41.110
What's wrong? The girl
doesn't look so well!

00:14:43.480 --> 00:14:46.440
How long do you think you can
fight without any spells?!

00:14:52.870 --> 00:14:54.660
What's wrong, Sherry?

00:14:54.660 --> 00:14:56.080
Are you done already?!

00:14:56.080 --> 00:14:58.620
This is nothing...

00:14:59.170 --> 00:15:02.330
Compared to that pain, this is...

00:15:08.470 --> 00:15:09.680
Stop it.

00:15:13.100 --> 00:15:15.850
Why is it that you can
only play like that?

00:15:16.060 --> 00:15:18.100
I'm sorry, Mother.

00:15:18.680 --> 00:15:20.440
Start over from the beginning,

00:15:20.440 --> 00:15:21.770
for six more hours.

00:15:22.690 --> 00:15:24.730
But it's already time for bed...

00:15:24.730 --> 00:15:26.030
Quiet!

00:15:26.530 --> 00:15:28.900
You're a daughter of
the Belmond family,

00:15:28.900 --> 00:15:31.910
you must become properly educated,

00:15:31.910 --> 00:15:34.780
in order not to embarrass
the name you've inherited.

00:15:35.450 --> 00:15:38.120
If you have time to sleep,
spend it practicing instead!

00:15:38.450 --> 00:15:40.290
Yes, Mother...

00:15:42.630 --> 00:15:45.670
How could you not understand
something like this?!

00:15:47.880 --> 00:15:50.130
Why can't you do something like this?!

00:15:51.180 --> 00:15:54.390
Sherry, I'm not sure how I should
say this so you can understand...

00:15:54.930 --> 00:15:59.810
As a daughter of the Belmond family...

00:16:00.640 --> 00:16:02.350
Mother...?

00:16:02.850 --> 00:16:07.320
Why did such a useless child
like you have to be born?!

00:16:10.570 --> 00:16:11.860
I see...

00:16:12.360 --> 00:16:15.200
So I shouldn't have been born...

00:16:16.200 --> 00:16:18.910
That's why Mother gets angry...

00:16:26.630 --> 00:16:28.420
If I don't die now,

00:16:28.590 --> 00:16:30.130
it will continue...

00:16:30.260 --> 00:16:32.680
for the rest of my life...

00:16:47.310 --> 00:16:52.110
Hey, demon! If you don't protect your
owner, we'll burn your book!

00:16:52.780 --> 00:16:53.950
There's no end to this.

00:16:53.950 --> 00:16:56.990
If I just knew where they were,
this battle would be...

00:16:56.990 --> 00:16:59.700
We don't need to know where they are...

00:17:00.160 --> 00:17:01.950
Let's destroy everything.

00:17:01.950 --> 00:17:03.120
What?!

00:17:09.210 --> 00:17:11.300
Why did you do that?!

00:17:11.300 --> 00:17:13.840
You really could've died!

00:17:15.430 --> 00:17:17.510
It's painful...

00:17:17.510 --> 00:17:20.010
It's painful to live...

00:17:20.010 --> 00:17:21.060
Idiot!

00:17:22.270 --> 00:17:26.770
If you die now, what'll happen to your
happiness when you're older?!

00:17:27.190 --> 00:17:30.400
The happiness when you're older?

00:17:30.400 --> 00:17:32.320
It may be painful right now...

00:17:32.320 --> 00:17:35.240
It might feel like the inside
of a pitch black tunnel...

00:17:35.240 --> 00:17:38.780
But you must keep walking
and look for the light!

00:17:40.780 --> 00:17:42.370
Isn't that right?

00:17:42.370 --> 00:17:44.910
Every tunnel has an exit, right?!

00:17:44.910 --> 00:17:48.630
That's why as long as you keep trying,
you'll eventually find the light!

00:17:50.840 --> 00:17:53.670
That's why you can't die!

00:17:53.670 --> 00:17:57.890
If you die now, you won't be able to find
that happiness when you're older!

00:18:01.680 --> 00:18:02.970
That's right...

00:18:02.970 --> 00:18:05.350
We're going to become happy...

00:18:06.890 --> 00:18:12.730
We can't allow our happiness to
be stolen by this demon battle!

00:18:19.200 --> 00:18:20.160
Koko!

00:18:30.880 --> 00:18:35.420
Koko, you've entered a
dark tunnel again...

00:18:37.260 --> 00:18:38.930
I'll enter it, as well!

00:18:40.340 --> 00:18:41.550
This is the end!

00:18:45.470 --> 00:18:47.060
Isn't that right, Koko?!

00:18:47.060 --> 00:18:49.190
You saved my life.

00:18:49.190 --> 00:18:52.730
I can't leave you behind
and become happy alone!

00:18:55.650 --> 00:18:57.280
Aian Gurabirei!

00:19:01.820 --> 00:19:03.490
Now it's my turn...

00:19:03.780 --> 00:19:05.870
My turn to save you!

00:19:06.830 --> 00:19:09.120
I'll keep releasing power!

00:19:09.330 --> 00:19:12.420
Brago, destroy everything around us!

00:19:24.720 --> 00:19:25.720
Koko!

00:19:35.770 --> 00:19:36.980
Still alive?

00:19:42.160 --> 00:19:43.410
How strange...

00:19:43.410 --> 00:19:45.530
Even after releasing all of that power,

00:19:45.530 --> 00:19:47.540
neither the demon
nor the human died.

00:19:48.580 --> 00:19:52.460
Was it through control of power...
or some special feeling?

00:19:53.380 --> 00:19:55.750
I'm going to burn the book,
so give me some fire.

00:19:57.630 --> 00:19:58.800
Sherry...

00:19:59.260 --> 00:20:00.970
I'm sorry, Brago...

00:20:01.470 --> 00:20:02.970
I'm going to rest a bit.

00:20:03.550 --> 00:20:05.800
I've been saved by you again...

00:20:06.640 --> 00:20:08.770
Goodbye, Sherry!

00:20:09.560 --> 00:20:11.480
Open your eyes, Koko!

00:20:11.480 --> 00:20:12.730
Radomu!

00:20:16.770 --> 00:20:18.650
- Let's go.
- Yes.

00:20:25.620 --> 00:20:27.830
It seems that I was able to save you...

00:20:31.330 --> 00:20:32.620
You...

00:20:35.000 --> 00:20:37.130
Try to read that book.

00:20:38.500 --> 00:20:41.130
Yes, even that time...

00:20:43.260 --> 00:20:45.140
Damn, a fever.

00:20:46.300 --> 00:20:48.470
Weakling, collapsing like this...

00:20:52.310 --> 00:20:58.150
Damn it, why do we have to pair up with
these weak things for the battle?

00:21:05.110 --> 00:21:05.160
{Ending}

00:21:16.290 --> 00:21:20.880
ne konna koto tsuzukete itemo

00:21:16.290 --> 00:21:20.880
You know, even if we continue to progress like this

00:21:21.420 --> 00:21:26.090
shiawase wa mitsukaru no kana?

00:21:21.420 --> 00:21:26.090
Will we be able to find true happiness?

00:21:26.720 --> 00:21:31.180
tarinai mono kazoete mitemo

00:21:26.720 --> 00:21:31.180
When I try counting what is missing in my life

00:21:31.930 --> 00:21:36.350
kiri ga nai no wakatteru you

00:21:31.930 --> 00:21:36.350
I know the list will keep going on and on

00:21:36.850 --> 00:21:42.030
shinario douri nante

00:21:36.850 --> 00:21:42.030
Everything goes according to plans

00:21:42.320 --> 00:21:46.740
umaku iku wake nai kara

00:21:42.320 --> 00:21:46.740
Of course that can never happen

00:21:47.160 --> 00:21:49.410
toki ni wa zenbu

00:21:47.160 --> 00:21:49.410
At times, everything that I have

00:21:49.740 --> 00:21:52.240
nagedashi taku naru

00:21:49.740 --> 00:21:52.240
I just want to let it all go

00:21:52.700 --> 00:21:58.040
sonna hi ga attemo iiyone

00:21:52.700 --> 00:21:58.040
Is it uncommon to have days like this?

00:22:00.670 --> 00:22:05.590
hito wa mina okubyou dakara

00:22:00.670 --> 00:22:05.590
Everyone is afraid, even though we don't show it

00:22:05.800 --> 00:22:10.100
yume wo miru no kana?

00:22:05.800 --> 00:22:10.100
Is that why we dream?

00:22:11.010 --> 00:22:15.930
hito wa mina kodoku dakara

00:22:11.010 --> 00:22:15.930
Everyone feels lonely on the inside

00:22:16.180 --> 00:22:20.480
ai wo sagasu no kana?

00:22:16.180 --> 00:22:20.480
Is that why we look for love?

00:22:20.940 --> 00:22:23.480
kitto chigau

00:22:20.940 --> 00:22:23.480
Even though you are not here

00:22:23.610 --> 00:22:25.900
basho de kimi mo

00:22:23.610 --> 00:22:25.900
know that where ever you are

00:22:26.360 --> 00:22:28.070
onaji tsuki wo

00:22:26.360 --> 00:22:28.070
You are gazing up

00:22:28.280 --> 00:22:31.740
miteru you ne...

00:22:28.280 --> 00:22:31.740
at the same moon as me...

00:22:35.120 --> 00:22:35.160
{Preview}

00:22:37.920 --> 00:22:42.090
Recently, when the wind blows, things have been
disappearing in the Mochinoki shopping district.

00:22:42.090 --> 00:22:46.210
All right, Kiyomaro!
Let's solve this mystery!

00:22:46.210 --> 00:22:48.590
Now my big yellowtail burger disappeared!{gl}

00:22:48.590 --> 00:22:50.590
That's absurd!{gl}

00:22:50.590 --> 00:22:53.930
Is that the demon who
uses wind techniques?

00:22:54.560 --> 00:22:56.520
Next time on Konjiki no Gash Bell:

00:22:56.520 --> 00:22:58.940
Showdown! Gash vs. Hyde!

00:22:58.940 --> 00:23:01.980
That yellowtail burger is mine!

00:23:01.980 --> 00:23:05.110
Showdown! Gash vs. Hyde
